v("workflow","/ˈwɜːrkfloʊ/","n.","工作流程","What does your workflow look like when an accident happens?","发生事故时，你们的处理流程是怎样的？","",1),
v("review","/rɪˈvjuː/","v./n.","审核；查看","Someone has to review every high-risk event within 24 hours.","每个高风险事件都必须在 24 小时内有人审核。","",0),
v("idling","/ˈaɪdlɪŋ/","n.","怠速","Idling wastes a lot of fuel in winter.","冬天怠速非常费油。","idle 和 idol 读音相同。",1),
