v("fuel theft","/ˈfjuːəl ˌθɛft/","n.","偷油","Fuel theft is a big problem for our customers in Brazil.","偷油对我们巴西的客户来说是个大问题。","也说 fuel siphoning（抽油）。",0),
v("utilization","/ˌjuːtələˈzeɪʃən/","n.","利用率","Low utilization means some vehicles are sitting idle.","利用率低说明有些车在闲置。","",0),
v("compliance","/kəmˈplaɪəns/","n.","合规","Compliance rules are different in every country.","每个国家的合规要求都不一样。","comply with = 遵守。",1),
v("ELD","/ˌiː ɛl ˈdiː/","n.","电子行车日志设备（北美法规）","In the US and Canada, fleets must use an ELD to record hours of service.","在美国和加拿大，车队必须用 ELD 记录驾驶工时。","HOS = hours of service（驾驶工时规定）。",0,"E L D"),
