v("maintenance","/ˈmeɪntənəns/","n.","维护保养","Preventive maintenance reduces unexpected breakdowns.","预防性保养能减少意外故障。","读 MAIN-te-nance，不是 maintain-ance。",0),
v("fault code","/ˈfɔːlt ˌkoʊd/","n.","故障码（DTC）","Engine fault codes are read from the OBD port.","发动机故障码是从 OBD 接口读取的。","",0),
v("report","/rɪˈpɔːrt/","n.","报表","Can I schedule this report to be sent every Monday?","这个报表能设置成每周一自动发送吗？","",1),
